1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,420
My dog Max had barked

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,400
at the same wall

3
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,310
at 3 AM

4
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:05,110
every night for a week,

5
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:05,740
and I was about

6
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:06,860
to give him away.

7
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,070
The first night,

8
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:09,610
I figured he heard a mouse.

9
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:10,510
I pressed my ear

10
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:12,470
against the wall and heard nothing.

11
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:14,390
"Max, go to sleep!"

12
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,940
He whined and clawed

13
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:16,480
at the paint

14
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:18,170
like his life depended on it.

15
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,330
By Thursday, I hadn't slept

16
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:21,770
in four days.

17
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,850
My girlfriend rolled over and groaned,

18
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,120
"It's your dog,

19
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,110
you fix it."

20
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:27,920
"The neighbor is 84,

21
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,510
he's asleep by 7!"

22
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:30,780
I dragged Max out

23
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:31,580
by his collar,

24
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:32,490
but he broke free

25
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:33,690
and sprinted right back

26
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:34,450
to the wall.

27
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:36,550
That morning, I wrote a post:

28
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:38,030
Free to a good home:

29
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:39,540
one loud dog.

30
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:41,020
I hit save as a draft

31
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,630
and went to bed angry.

32
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:43,940
At 3 AM,

33
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:45,300
Max started again,

34
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,220
but this time

35
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:47,260
he wasn't barking.

36
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:48,620
He was howling,

37
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:50,000
throwing his whole body

38
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,030
against the wall.

39
00:00:51,190 --> 00:00:52,700
I opened my mouth to yell,

40
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:53,620
and then I heard it

41
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:54,650
through the drywall:

42
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:55,650
thump...

43
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:56,590
thump...

44
00:00:56,810 --> 00:00:57,520
thump.

45
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,350
My stomach dropped.

46
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,610
I ran into the hallway

47
00:01:00,610 --> 00:01:01,260
in my socks

48
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:03,220
and pounded on Mr. Harlan's door.

49
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:04,960
"Sir, are you okay?!"

50
00:01:05,210 --> 00:01:05,870
Nothing.

51
00:01:06,190 --> 00:01:07,330
Then the weak sound

52
00:01:07,330 --> 00:01:08,810
of someone tapping back.

53
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,100
I called 911,

54
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:11,460
and by the time the paramedics

55
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:12,500
broke the door down,

56
00:01:12,510 --> 00:01:14,030
Max was already scratching

57
00:01:14,030 --> 00:01:14,870
at the bathroom.

58
00:01:15,070 --> 00:01:16,890
Mr. Harlan was on the floor.

59
00:01:16,890 --> 00:01:18,390
He'd fallen hours earlier

60
00:01:18,390 --> 00:01:19,750
and couldn't reach his phone.

61
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,000
The paramedic looked at me

62
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,570
and said, "Another hour,

63
00:01:22,570 --> 00:01:23,450
and we wouldn't have been

64
00:01:23,450 --> 00:01:24,930
having this conversation."

65
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:26,720
I went back to my apartment

66
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,020
and deleted the post.

67
00:01:28,270 --> 00:01:29,720
Max got a whole steak

68
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:30,360
that night.

69
00:01:30,580 --> 00:01:31,580
And Mr. Harlan?

70
00:01:31,730 --> 00:01:32,790
Every Sunday now,

71
00:01:32,790 --> 00:01:34,660
he knocks on our wall twice,

72
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:36,233
and Max barks back.
